    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492460/extras/0314b28634a65b8913008d47e8a952f7.poster.avif?t=1740856000\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492460/extras/0314b28634a65b8913008d47e8a952f7.webm?t=1740856000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492460/extras/0314b28634a65b8913008d47e8a952f7.mp4?t=1740856000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a gladiator thrust into a ruthless world where only the strongest endure. You begin as an unknown fighter, forced to prove your worth in the arena where every battle is a chance to rise or fall into oblivion. Your journey takes you from obscurity to legend, with your helm and blade becoming symbols of your legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492460/extras/5b8be10778fe3f74b92620f43ae30ba9.poster.avif?t=1740856000\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492460/extras/5b8be10778fe3f74b92620f43ae30ba9.webm?t=1740856000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492460/extras/5b8be10778fe3f74b92620f43ae30ba9.mp4?t=1740856000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This single-player RPG immerses you in a gripping experience of growth and survival. Develop unique attributes, master various weapons, and refine your skills. The turn-based combat system demands strategy, considering your character's fatigue, armor coverage, and the protection of individual body parts. Every move counts, and every decision can mean the difference between victory and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware\u2014death in this world is permanent. Should you fall, you must start anew, but not without reward. Each session grants you points to spend when creating a stronger, more experienced warrior. This is a tale of determination, strategy, and the unyielding will to conquer a world where everything is against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492460/extras/0314b28634a65b8913008d47e8a952f7.poster.avif?t=1740856000\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492460/extras/0314b28634a65b8913008d47e8a952f7.webm?t=1740856000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492460/extras/0314b28634a65b8913008d47e8a952f7.mp4?t=1740856000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a gladiator thrust into a ruthless world where only the strongest endure. You begin as an unknown fighter, forced to prove your worth in the arena where every battle is a chance to rise or fall into oblivion. Your journey takes you from obscurity to legend, with your helm and blade becoming symbols of your legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492460/extras/5b8be10778fe3f74b92620f43ae30ba9.poster.avif?t=1740856000\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492460/extras/5b8be10778fe3f74b92620f43ae30ba9.webm?t=1740856000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492460/extras/5b8be10778fe3f74b92620f43ae30ba9.mp4?t=1740856000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This single-player RPG immerses you in a gripping experience of growth and survival. Develop unique attributes, master various weapons, and refine your skills. The turn-based combat system demands strategy, considering your character's fatigue, armor coverage, and the protection of individual body parts. Every move counts, and every decision can mean the difference between victory and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware\u2014death in this world is permanent. Should you fall, you must start anew, but not without reward. Each session grants you points to spend when creating a stronger, more experienced warrior. This is a tale of determination, strategy, and the unyielding will to conquer a world where everything is against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Enter the world of a gladiator where only the strongest survive. Rise from an unknown fighter to a legend in this RPG. Master skills, weapons, and strategic turn-based combat. Manage fatigue, armor, and risk permanent death. Earn points after each session to grow stronger in your next life",
